  "title": "Kanye West pulls plug on Marseille concert, postpones until further notice",
  "summary": "US rapper Kanye West said on Tuesday he had postponed his show in Marseille, France’s second-largest city, until further notice. The 48-year-old, now known as Ye, said on X he made the decision after “much thought and consideration.” He had been due to perform on June 11.",
